  "scope": [
    "Correct terminal Work Item categorization and prevent registered Codex task history synchronization from blocking local Dashboard availability."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "Done and cancelled Work Items are represented as terminal rather than queued in Observer data, Dashboard metrics, and tests.",
    "The loopback HTTP health and snapshot surfaces become available without waiting for Codex provider history synchronization.",
    "Initial Codex history synchronization is explicitly bounded while live events and honest unknown or registered-only states remain available.",
    "Existing privacy, replay, provider capability, and no-external-mutation guarantees continue to pass.",
    "Operations and validation documentation explain startup order, history bounds, terminal categories, and retained limits."
  ],
